{"author":"Joe Oakhart","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"f34414621e164e4c08b7248f1bb96655b5dbc2567205a6ae232e9349e4b7af28","digest":{"component_or_area":"CI/CD workflow gates","key_entities":[".github/workflows/test.yml","gerrit-verify.yaml","scripts/check_readme_quickstart.py","scripts/probe_rebar.py","tests/unit/test_predates_gate_guard_parity.py","golden-path job"],"problem_keywords":["gate guard","predates gate","parity","workflow","test.yml"],"propositions":["The golden-path job in test.yml runs two scripts without predates-gate guards, while the equivalent steps in gerrit-verify.yaml are guarded, creating parity gap.","A change whose base predates either script causes the mirror lane to fail on a gate fault rather than a code change fault.","Both golden-path steps must carry canonical if-present guards matching gerrit-verify.yaml wording and be verified by parity test.","The predates-gate guard markers in test_predates_gate_guard_parity.py must be removed after guards are added to test.yml steps."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787542358060845001,"uuid":"372941a2-f989-4ea8-91a9-221a7d595c40"}